      en: ["Batokunku became the site of Gambia's first 150 kW wind turbine in 2009.", "The wind energy project was a joint venture between a private German donor and the local community.", "The village is located along the strategically important South Atlantic Highway.", "Batokunku is celebrated for its unspoiled and relatively secluded beaches.", "The majority of the local residents belong to the Mandinka ethnic group.", "The community manages an innovative decentralized water and power distribution system."],
