      en: ["Site of Africa's first SOS Children's Village (est. 1982)", "Major residential district within the Kanifing Municipality", "Home to the country's primary and largest dumpsite", "The Bakoteh Bridge is a key crossing over the Kotu Stream", "Center for various educational and vocational training facilities", "Strategically located near the main Serrekunda commercial zone"],
      es: ["Importante institución social.", "Densa edificación residencial.", "Estructura comercial local diversa.", "Parte integrante del municipio de Kanifing.", "Centro de apoyo social a pequeña escala.", "Típico barrio residencial urbano en Serekunda."],
